    {
      "jobId": "37575ba3-baa8-48da-acf6-ce57528e3c52",
      "question": "As of the March 5, 2026 market close, which of the 50 most liquid US stocks are most likely to fall more than 5% over the next five sessions?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:56:22.837322Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T18:57:28.073074Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**CRWV ranks highest, followed by INTC and BMNR**, in the model’s downside-risk ranking among the 50 most liquid stocks as of the **March 5, 2026 close (21:00 UTC)**. [1]\n\n**The horizon is not an exact match:** the available model predicts a five-session adjusted-close return below −5% **realized within five calendar days after the anchor**, rather than explicitly over the next five trading sessions. Its top 10 predictions are below. [1]\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Predicted probability |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | CRWV | 48.0% [1] |\n| 2 | INTC | 43.8% [1] |\n| 3 | BMNR | 38.9% [1] |\n| 4 | CRCL | 35.6% [1] |\n| 5 | APP | 32.9% [1] |\n| 6 | COIN | 31.4% [1] |\n| 7 | CRWD | 30.7% [1] |\n| 8 | WFC | 29.9% [1] |\n| 9 | AMD | 29.7% [1] |\n| 10 | BABA | 29.4% [1] |\n\nThese are **Kumo Relational model probabilities**, not expected loss percentages or observed outcomes. None of the 50 stocks has a predicted probability above 50% under this template. [1]\n\n**Limitations:** An exact next-five-trading-sessions forecast could not be confirmed with the available template.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — material_downside — evidence `hermes-receipt:27191570aed576726e8b1cc7ebb8691483879c65507a85ff2882fb825167c181`",
